$AMD is buying @theworldlabs for ~$8.2 Billion in stock. 🙈

@drfeifei Lab builds spatial intelligence: models that generate, reconstruct, and simulate interactive 3D worlds from text, image, and video. Plus robotic learning and simulation. 🦾

After closing, Li becomes AMD EVP and chief scientist, reporting directly to @LisaSu, while the team keeps doing model research. Expected to close by the end of 2026.

@AMD is fighting with @nvidia to define the AI stack. Their last cycle was strictly LLMs, and their next is reasoning, robotics, simulation, and physical AI. If they only sell GPUs into whatever Nvidia software stack already defines, they will be an alternative.

I love this for AMD and @LisaSu

They want an open ecosystem. The harder question is whether a chip company can keep a frontier model lab sharp once it sits inside the @AMD roadmap process.
